                <pb facs="0261" n="155" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg155"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                    Hicks.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-19">August 19,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The people of the United States share in grief of Chile. President telegraphs
                    condolences.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
